# Keep the build context lean; the image builds the SPA + binary itself.
# NOTE: bare "target" only matches the ROOT target/. The Rust build output also
# lives at src-tauri/target (a stale 24GB dir on dev machines), so exclude target
# and node_modules at ANY depth - otherwise Docker ships gigabytes of artifacts
# as "context" (this hung an early build for 20 min transferring 24GB).
target
**/target
node_modules
**/node_modules
build
**/build
.svelte-kit
**/.svelte-kit
.git
.claude
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
copy-review-*.html
launch-*.vbs
launch-*.bat
scripts
